 back it.","With nothing proven, acceptance is reported NOT_SUPPORTED and is not claimable, even though the policy guard is green because nothing is blocking.","A green guard is never quotable as acceptance.","An UNBOUND row is never counted as proven, so a matrix with unbound rows cannot claim acceptance.","The summary counts the local axis (verified / stale / unverified) alongside the signed axis, so a green keyless matrix does not read as a failing one."],"teardown_steps":[],"required_permissions":[],"safety_constraints":[],"verification_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"requirements","verifiers":{"script":{"kind":"script","evidence_kind":"test_result","command":["pnpm","-s","vitest","run","tests/blackbox/lifecycle-signals.test.ts","-t","lifecycle.signals.acceptance_claim_is_honest"],"inputs":["tests/blackbox/lifecycle-signals.test.ts"]}},"requirements":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1}]},"approval_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"none"},"approval_resolution_required_at_run_start":false,"required_evidence":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1,"status":"missing"}],"evidence_summary":{"readiness":"missing","active_evidence_ids":[],"basis":"no_active_evidence"},"freshness_summary":{"state":"unknown","basis":"missing_evidence"},"known_gaps":[{"code":"evidence_missing","message":"Required evidence is missing; live performance is still required.","severity":"warning"}],"selection_reasons":["Critical value use case.","Golden path is preferred for a high-level showcase.","Common usage frequency."],"selection_reason_codes":["value_critical","journey_golden","frequency_common"],"score_components":{"changed":0,"value":400,"journey":50,"frequency":30}},{"plan_item_id":"item.lifecycle.signals.local_results_are_attested","presentation_format":"reviewing","delivery_kind":"evidence_review","scenario_scope":"explicit","use_case_id":"lifecycle.signals.local_results_are_attested","use_case_title":"A verification result must prove a run wrote it","scenario_ids":["lifecycle.signals.local_results_are_attested.golden_real_run","lifecycle.signals.local_results_are_attested.bad_typed_line","lifecycle.signals.local_results_are_attested.bad_edited_record","lifecycle.signals.local_results_are_attested.edge_ledger_from_another_machine","lifecycle.signals.local_results_are_attested.edge_scan_never_mints_a_key"],"use_case_content_hash":"sha256:80656ac52d628aaad094f037b31ab9dd4b424f8fbb052254cabe7b538282830c","estimated_seconds":120,"estimate_source":"default_profile","setup_steps":[],"resolved_steps":["Run uc verify for a bound row so the verifier is actually spawned.","Read the emitted record, then scan and read the row's local status.","Hand-write a results line whose hashes all match the current code.","Scan and read the row's local status and the acceptance claim.","Take a genuine attested record of a FAILED run and edit its status to pass.","Scan and read whether the row is proven.","Copy in a results ledger attested with a different machine's key.","Scan and read the row's local status.","Remove the machine-local run key and run scan on a repo with no key present.","Check whether a key file appeared."],"expected_observations":["A record uc verify wrote carries a run attestation and reads VERIFIED_LOCAL.","Every record the tool emits carries an attestation, not only the passing ones.","A hand-written record with byte-perfect hashes reads UNATTESTED_LOCAL and is never counted as proven.","Matching hashes alone never move the claim, because anything that can read the repo can compute them.","Editing any field of an attested record, including flipping a failure to a pass, invalidates its attestation.","A laundered failure proves nothing.","A results ledger written on another machine reads unattested here, because someone else's run is not your evidence.","Scan never mints a key: a read-only command cannot attest anything.","A read-only command leaves no new key on disk.","A 