ce with different suffixes, then release only one.","Read which registrations survive."],"expected_observations":["The marker is removed from the source and the registration is released.","The same slug can be bound again afterwards, with no DUPLICATE_REGISTRATION.","Releasing a slug that is not registered is refused, and writes nothing.","A registration whose markers were already removed by hand is still releasable.","Hand-editing the source never strands a registration with no supported way out.","A dry-run reports the release it would make without touching source or registry.","Unbinding leaves nothing behind claiming the row is verified.","Releasing one suffixed binding leaves the other registered."],"teardown_steps":[],"required_permissions":[],"safety_constraints":[],"verification_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"requirements","verifiers":{"script":{"kind":"script","evidence_kind":"test_result","command":["pnpm","-s","vitest","run","tests/blackbox/lifecycle-bindings.test.ts","-t","lifecycle.bindings.unbind_releases_a_registration"],"inputs":["tests/blackbox/lifecycle-bindings.test.ts"]}},"requirements":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1}]},"approval_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"none"},"approval_resolution_required_at_run_start":false,"required_evidence":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1,"status":"missing"}],"evidence_summary":{"readiness":"missing","active_evidence_ids":[],"basis":"no_active_evidence"},"freshness_summary":{"state":"unknown","basis":"missing_evidence"},"known_gaps":[{"code":"evidence_missing","message":"Required evidence is missing; live performance is still required.","severity":"warning"}],"selection_reasons":["Core value use case.","Alternate journey coverage.","Occasional usage frequency."],"selection_reason_codes":["value_core","journey_alternate","frequency_occasional"],"score_components":{"changed":0,"value":300,"journey":45,"frequency":20}},{"plan_item_