tion first and sends a repo without one to /use-cases:init.","It covers understand, frame, build, verify, sign-off and land, and names bind, verify, scan and recover.","A repo without the decision is sent to init rather than asked ad hoc.","There is no talk-to-myself, no npm install, no ~/.claude path, no agent-setup skill named as a dependency, and no simulator or Xcode step.","One loop skill, read the same way on Claude, Copilot, Codex and OpenCode."],"teardown_steps":[],"required_permissions":[],"safety_constraints":[],"verification_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"requirements","verifiers":{"script":{"kind":"script","evidence_kind":"test_result","command":["pnpm","-s","vitest","run","tests/blackbox/plugin-init-loop-skill.test.ts","-t","plugin.init.loop_skill_ported"],"inputs":["tests/blackbox/plugin-init-loop-skill.test.ts"]}},"requirements":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1}]},"approval_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"none"},"approval_resolution_required_at_run_start":false,"required_evidence":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1,"status":"missing"}],"evidence_summary":{"readiness":"missing","active_evidence_ids":[],"basis":"no_active_evidence"},"freshness_summary":{"state":"unknown","basis":"missing_evidence"},"known_gaps":[{"code":"evidence_missing","message":"Required evidence is missing; live performance is still required.","severity":"warning"}],"selection_reasons":["Critical value use case.","Golden journey coverage.","Common usage frequency."],"selection_reason_codes":["value_critical","journey_golden","frequency_common"],"score_components":{"changed":0,"value":400,"journey":50,"frequency":30}},{"plan_item_id":"item.plugin.install.claude_from_github","presentation_format":"reviewing","delivery_kind":"evidence_review","scenario_scope":"explicit","use_case_id":"plugin.install.claude_from_github","use_case_title":"Claude Code installs the plugin straight from GitHub","scenario_ids":["plugin.install.claude_from_github.golden_manifests_point_at_real_files","plugin.install.claude_from_github.golden_marketplace_offers_the_repo_root","plugin.install.claude_from_github.golden_skills_in_the_scanned_dir","plugin.install.claude_from_github.bad_manifest_pointing_at_a_missing_file","plugin.install.claude_from_github.edge_live_session"],"use_case_content_hash":"sha256:f16e5bb04d7684964a5cddc4b7955b470da831361318a4db8562fc48867394a4","estimated_seconds":180,"estimate_source":"default_profile","setup_steps":[],"resolved_steps":["Read .claude-plugin/plugin.json.","Confirm every declared agent path exists, the MCP server command is node on ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/dist/uc-mcp.js, and hooks resolve to hooks/hooks.json.","Read .claude-plugin/marketplace.json.","Confirm it offers use-cases with source \".\" so the plugin is the repo root.","Confirm the four canonical skills live under skills/<name>/SKILL.md at the repo root, the directory Claude scans by default.","Confirm each SKILL.md front-matter name matches its directory.","Point a manifest entry at a file that does not exist.","Run the manifest test.","In Claude Code run the two install commands, then start a new session.","Confirm the four skills are listed, the three agents are available, and the use-cases MCP server reports its tools."],"expected_observations":["Every entry in the Claude manifest points at a file that exists and at the committed bundle.","Two commands install the plugin; nothing else is downloaded or built.","Skills appear as /use-cases:<skill> because the front-matter name matches the directory.","A manifest that points at a missing file fails the test before it can ship.","A broken install is caught here rather than on a user's machine.","Skills appear as /use-cases:<skill> and the MCP tools are live on the next session."],"teardown_steps":[],"required_permissions":[],"safety_constraints":[],"verification_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"requirements","verifiers":{"script":{"kind":"script",