ue use case.","Alternate journey coverage.","Occasional usage frequency."],"selection_reason_codes":["value_critical","journey_alternate","frequency_occasional"],"score_components":{"changed":0,"value":400,"journey":45,"frequency":20}},{"plan_item_id":"item.lifecycle.signals.nested_workspace_is_not_scanned","presentation_format":"reviewing","delivery_kind":"evidence_review","scenario_scope":"explicit","use_case_id":"lifecycle.signals.nested_workspace_is_not_scanned","use_case_title":"A nested workspace's markers are never read as the parent's","scenario_ids":["lifecycle.signals.nested_workspace_is_not_scanned.golden_nested_fixture_is_skipped","lifecycle.signals.nested_workspace_is_not_scanned.bad_no_parent_diagnostics_for_nested_markers","lifecycle.signals.nested_workspace_is_not_scanned.edge_any_directory_name","lifecycle.signals.nested_workspace_is_not_scanned.edge_root_config_does_not_skip_the_repo","lifecycle.signals.nested_workspace_is_not_scanned.edge_nested_workspace_still_scans_itself","lifecycle.signals.nested_workspace_is_not_scanned.edge_build_and_worktree_copies_are_skipped"],"use_case_content_hash":"sha256:fb5e74339937b70c1610e806b7c94e532c3767c3d48258489dbe9ed896eb35c5","estimated_seconds":180,"estimate_source":"default_profile","setup_steps":[],"resolved_steps":["Place a nested workspace config plus a marked source file under a test-fixture path.","Scan from the parent root and read which files were collected.","Give the nested workspace markers whose rows exist only in ITS matrix.","Scan from the parent root and read the diagnostics.","Repeat with the nested workspace under a directory with no blessed name, such as vendor/demo-app.","Confirm it is skipped because of its config, not its name.","Scan a repository whose OWN product root carries a use-cases.yml.","Confirm the root's config does not skip the entire repository.","Run scan with --repo pointed at the nested workspace directory itself.","Read whether its own markers are collected.","Copy a marked source file into a build output directory and into a worktree copy of the repo.","Scan from the parent root and read whether a duplicate binding slug is reported."],"expected_observations":["A directory carrying its own use-cases.yml or use-cases.yaml is not walked by the parent's scan.","The parent scan no longer emits UNREGISTERED_BINDING or ROW_NOT_FOUND for markers that belong to a nested workspace.","A nested workspace can never fail the parent's integrity gate.","The rule keys on the workspace config file, so a newly added nested workspace needs no hardcoded skip entry.","The check applies to child directories only; the product root's own config still scans the whole repository.","A nested workspace's own scan --repo <dir> is unaffected, because its config sits at its product root rather than below it.","A marker copied into a build directory or a repo copy is not scanned, so a copy never collides with the original.","No DUPLICATE_BINDING_SLUG is raised for a file the build produced.","A nested workspace's own `scan --repo <dir>` is unaffected, because its config sits at its product root rather than below it."],"teardown_steps":[],"required_permissions":[],"safety_constraints":[],"verification_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"requirements","verifiers":{"script":{"kind":"script","evidence_kind":"test_result","command":["pnpm","-s","vitest","run","tests/blackbox/lifecycle-signals.test.ts","-t","lifecycle.signals.nested_workspace_is_not_scanned"],"inputs":["tests/blackbox/lifecycle-signals.test.ts"]}},"requirements":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1}]},"approval_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"none"},"approval_resolution_required_at_run_start":false,"required_evidence":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1,"status":"missing"}],"evidence_summary":{"readiness":"missing","active_evidence_ids":[],"basis":"no_active_evidence"},"freshness_summary":{"state":"unknown","basis":"missing_evi