es command semantics.","The same command reached two ways gives the same answer.","Core product logic remains in the CLI and core layer, so the two surfaces cannot drift apart.","Transport details are allowed to differ; the semantic result is what parity means.","Core product logic remains in the CLI/core layer."],"teardown_steps":[],"required_permissions":[],"safety_constraints":[],"verification_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"requirements","verifiers":{"script":{"kind":"script","evidence_kind":"test_result","command":["pnpm","-s","vitest","run","tests/blackbox/mcp-surface.test.ts","-t","mcp.surface.cli_contract_transport"],"inputs":["tests/blackbox/mcp-surface.test.ts","tests/helpers/mcp-server.ts"]}},"requirements":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1}]},"approval_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"none"},"approval_resolution_required_at_run_start":false,"required_evidence":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1,"status":"missing"}],"evidence_summary":{"readiness":"missing","active_evidence_ids":[],"basis":"no_active_evidence"},"freshness_summary":{"state":"unknown","basis":"missing_evidence"},"known_gaps":[{"code":"evidence_missing","message":"Required evidence is missing; live performance is still required.","severity":"warning"}],"selection_reasons":["Critical value use case.","Golden journey coverage.","Common usage frequency."],"selection_reason_codes":["value_critical","journey_golden","frequency_common"],"score_components":{"changed":0,"value":400,"journey":50,"frequency":30}},{"plan_item_id":"item.planning.cards.showcase_selection","presentation_format":"user_led","delivery_kind":"evidence_review","scenario_scope":"explicit","use_case_id":"planning.cards.showcase_selection","use_case_title":"High-value showcase selection","scenario_ids":["planning.cards.showcase_selection.golden_cli","planning.cards.showcase_selection.bad_a_plan_is_not_proof","planning.cards.showcase_selection.edge_reasons_and_exclusions_are_reported"],"use_case_content_hash":"sha256:5dcc1e8c3019e04cd421a9e47abb9eaed2f4bae497334bbc356b89425745991d","estimated_seconds":180,"estimate_source":"default_profile","setup_steps":[],"resolved_steps":["Run plan showcase with a max item limit.","Confirm selected rows prioritise critical or core golden paths.","Generate a showcase plan and stop there.","Read whether anything reports it as proven.","Read the plan's reasons, exclusions, evidence gaps and prepared-not-performed status.","Confirm an excluded row can be explained."],"expected_observations":["The plan is concise and reasoned, and fits the limit it was given.","It remains prepared material until a showcase run records events.","Every selection carries its reason, and every exclusion is visible rather than silent.","The plan is concise and reasoned."],"teardown_steps":[],"required_permissions":[],"safety_constraints":[],"verification_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"requirements","verifiers":{"script":{"kind":"script","evidence_kind":"test_result","command":["pnpm","-s","vitest","run","tests/blackbox/planning-cards.test.ts","-t","planning.cards.showcase_selection"],"inputs":["tests/blackbox/planning-cards.test.ts"]}},"requirements":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1}]},"approval_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"ask"},"approval_resolution_required_at_run_start":true,"required_evidence":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1,"status":"missing"}],"evidence_summary":{"readiness":"missing","active_evidence_ids":[],"basis":"no_active_evidence"},"freshness_summary":{"state":"unknown","basis":"missing_evidence"},"known_gaps":[{"code":"evidence_missing","message":"Required evidence is missing; live performance is still required.","severity":"warning"},{"code":"approval_resolution_required","message":"Approval policy must be resolved during the later live run.","severity":"info"}],"selection_reasons":["Critical value use case.","Golden journey coverage.","Common usage frequency."],"selection_reason_codes":["value_critical","journey_golden","frequency_common"],"score_components":{"changed":0,"value":400,"journey":50,"frequency":30}},{"plan_item_id":"item.plugin.bundle.runs_from_clean_clone","presentation_format":"reviewing","delivery_kind":"evidence_review","scenario_scope":"explicit","use_case_id":"plugin.bundle.runs_from_clean_clone","use_case_title":"Committed bundle runs from a clean clone","scenario_ids":["plugin.bundle.runs_from_clean_clone.golden_cli","plugin.bundle.runs_from_clean_clone.golden_mcp","plugin.bundle.runs_from_clean_clone.bad_drift","plugin.bundle.runs_from_clean_clone.edge_workspace_paths_resolve_from_the_bundle"],"use_case_content_hash":"sha256:4080139ac5e34e316509a5b456173ec3021cb90effebbfd93e1e4fe6165e3a06","estimated_seconds":180,"estimate_source":"default_profile","setup_steps":[],"resolved_steps":["Copy the tracked files of the repo to an empty directory with no node_modules.","Run node dist/uc.js version --json.","In the same clean copy, start node dist/uc-mcp.js over stdio.","Send initialize and tools/list.","Rebuild the bundle from source into a temporary directory.","Compare it byte-for-byte with the committed dist/.","In the clean copy, run node dist/uc.js matrix validate --repo <fixture> --json.","Read where schemas and marker validators were loaded from."],"expected_observations":["The CLI runs in a clone with no node_modules and prints its version envelope.","The MCP server answers and lists the use-case tools, with no install or build step.","A difference fails and names the file, so a stale bundle cannot land.","The committed bundle always matches the source it was built from.","Schemas and marker validators resolve from the bundle's own location.","The bundle never depends on packages/*/dist existing.","node dist/uc.js and node dist/uc-mcp.js work in a clone with no node_modules."],"teardown_steps":[],"required_permissions":[],"safety_cons