he skill for the order it puts the phases in.","Check which uc commands and MCP tools each phase names.","Search the skill for machine- or host-specific instructions.","Check each hit against what a host other than Claude could do."],"expected_observations":["Its front-matter name matches the directory and the skill is in the canonical list, so doctor and every host see it.","It reads the AGENTS.md section first and sends a repo without one to /use-cases:init.","It covers understand, frame, build, verify, sign-off and land, and names bind, verify, scan and recover.","A repo without the decision is sent to init rather than asked ad hoc.","There is no talk-to-myself, no npm install, no ~/.claude path, no agent-setup skill named as a dependency, and no simulator or Xcode step.","One loop skill, read the same way on Claude, Copilot, Codex and OpenCode."],"teardown_steps":[],"required_permissions":[],"safety_constraints":[],"verification_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"requirements","verifiers":{"script":{"kind":"script","evidence_kind":"test_result","command":["pnpm","-s","vitest","run","tests/blackbox/plugin-init-loop-skill.test.ts","-t","plugin.init.loop_skill_ported"],"inputs":["tests/blackbox/plugin-init-loop-skill.test.ts"]}},"requirements":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1}]},"approval_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"none"},"approval_resolution_required_at_run_start":false,"required_evidence":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1,"status":"missing"}],"evidence_summary":{"readiness":"missing","active_evidence_ids":[],"basis":"no_active_evidence"},"freshness_summary":{"state":"unknown","basis":"missing_evidence"},"known_gaps":[{"code":"evidence_missing","message":"Required evidence is missing; live performance is still required.","severity":"warning"}],"selection_reasons":["Critical value use case.","Golden journey coverage.","Common usage frequency."],"selection_reason_codes":["value_critical","journey_golden","frequency_common"],"score_components":{"changed":0,"value":400,"journey":50,"frequency":30}},{"plan_item_id":"item.plugin.install.claude_from_github","presentation_format":"reviewing","delivery_kind":"evidence_review","scenario_scope":"explicit","use_case_id":"plugin.install.claude_from_github","use_case_title":"Claude Code installs the plugin straight from GitHub","scenario_ids":["plugin.install.claude_from_github.golden_manifests_point_at_real_files","plugin.install.claude_from_github.golden_marketplace_offers_the_repo_root","plugin.install.claude_from_github.golden_skills_in_the_scanned_dir","plugin.install.claude_from_github.bad_manifest_pointing_at_a_missing_file","plugin.install.claude_from_github.edge_live_session"],"use_case_content_hash":"sha256:f16e5bb04d7684964a5cddc4b7955b470da831361318a4db8562fc48867394a4","estimated_seconds":180,"estimate_source":"default_profile","setup_steps":[],"resolved_steps":["Read .claude-plugin/plugin.json.","Confirm every declared agent path exists, the MCP server command is node on ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/dist/uc-mcp.js, and hooks resolve to hooks/hooks.json.","Read .claude-plugin/marketplace.json.","Confirm it offers use-cases with source \".\" so the plugin is the repo root.","Confirm the four canonical skills live under skills/<name>/SKILL.md at the repo root, the directory Claude scans by default.","Confirm each SKILL.md front-matter name matches its directory.","Point a manifest entry at a file that does not exist.","Run the manifest test.","In Claude Code run the two install commands, then start a new session.","Confirm the four skills are listed, the three agents are available, and the use-cases MCP server reports its tools."],"expected_observations":["Every entry in the Claude manifest points at a file that exists and at the committed bundle.","Two commands install the plugin; nothing else is downloaded or built.","Skills appear as /use-cases:<skill> because the front-matter name matches the directory.","A manifest that points at a missing file fails the test before it can ship.","A broken install is caught here rather than on a user's machine.","Skills appear as /use-cases:<skill> and the MCP tools are live on the next session."],"teardown_steps":[],"required_permissions":[],"safety_constraints":[],"verification_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"requirements","verifiers":{"script":{"kind":"script","evidence_kind":"test_result","command":["pnpm","-s","vitest","run","tests/blackbox/plugin-install-claude.test.ts","-t","plugin.install.claude_from_github"],"inputs":["tests/blackbox/plugin-install-claude.test.ts"]}},"requirements":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1}]},"approval_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"none"},"approval_resolution_required_at_run_start":false,"required_evidence":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1,"status":"missing"}],"evidence_summary":{"readiness":"missing","active_evidence_ids":[],"basis":"no_active_evidence"},"freshness_summary":{"state":"unknown","basis":"missing_evidence"},"known_gaps":[{"code":"evidence_missing","message":"Required evidence is missing; live performance is still required.","severity":"warning"}],"selection_reasons":["Critical value use case.","Golden journey coverage.","Common usage frequency."],"selection_reason_codes":["value_critical","journey_golden","frequency_common"],"score_components":{"changed":0,"value":400,"journey":50,"frequency":30}},{"plan_item_id":"item.showcase.flow.live_acceptance_flow","presentation_format":"reviewing","delivery_kind":"evidence_review","scenario_scope":"explicit","use_case_id":"showcase.flow.live_acceptance_flow","use_case_title":"Performed live acceptance flow","scenario_ids":["showcase.flow.live_acceptance_flow.golden_cli","showcase.flow.live_acceptance_flow.bad_started_is_not_performed","showcase.flow.live_acceptance_flow.edge_approval_binds_to_the_finish_event"],"use_case_content_hash":"sha256:c6f08d3d465f40c08f269b3593a09d9d04224c81961b9abd485de47ec45cf037","estimated_seconds":180,"estimate_source":"default_profile","setup_steps":[],"resolved_steps":["Start a showcase run from a selected plan or ad hoc item list.","Record observation events for each item, then pass, partial, fail, blocked or waived verdicts.","Finish the run and inspect status.","Start a run and stop there.","Read the derived status and check for a summary file.","Attempt a trusted user approval before the run is finished, then after.","Read what the approval binds to."],"expected_observations":["Run status is derived from events in the JSONL ledger, not from a summary anyone wrote.","A started run derives prepared_not_performed and writes no summary file.","Starting is never mistaken for performing.","Trusted user approval requires a finished run and binds to the finish event.","User approval is absent until a trusted approval event exists.","Run status is derived from events in the JSONL ledger."],"teardown_steps":[],"required_permissions":[],"safety_constraints":[],"verification_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"requirements","verifiers":{"script":{"kind":"script","evidence_kind":"test_result","command":["pnpm","-s","vitest","run","tests/blackbox/showcase-flow.test.ts","-t","showcase.flow.live_acceptance_flow"],"inputs":["tests/blackbox/showcase-flow.test.ts"]}},"requirements":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1}]},"approval_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"predefined","requirements":[{"approver_type":"user","minimum_count":1}],"statement":"User accepts the demonstrated showcase scope."},"approval_resolution_required_at_run_start":false,"required_evidence":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1,"status":"missing"}],"evidence_summary":{"readiness":"missing","active_evidence_ids":[],"basis":"no_active_evidence"},"freshness_summary":{"state":"unknown","basis":"missing_evidence"},"known_gaps":[{"code":"evidence_missing",