printed keypair and the warning beside it.","Run keygen with --out pointing outside the repository.","Read the returned file paths.","Run keygen with --out pointing inside --repo.","Read the refusal.","Run keygen with --ci github.","Read the emitted snippet.","Run keygen twice and compare the two keypairs.","Sign and verify a round trip with one of them."],"expected_observations":["An ed25519 keypair is printed inline with a CI-only warning.","The private key is PKCS8 and the public key SPKI, both of which node:crypto accepts.","The keypair is written to disk and the file paths are returned.","Writing inside the repository is refused, so the private key cannot land in the tree.","A release-workflow snippet is emitted that uses id-token OIDC and carries no token.","Each call yields a fresh, distinct keypair.","A sign and verify round trip through the proof signature path passes.","An ed25519 keypair is produced, inline or to a directory outside the repository.","Writing the private key inside the repo is refused, so it cannot be committed by accident.","Each call yields a fresh keypair that signs and verifies through the proof path."],"teardown_steps":[],"required_permissions":[],"safety_constraints":[],"verification_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"requirements","verifiers":{"script":{"kind":"script","evidence_kind":"test_result","command":["pnpm","-s","vitest","run","tests/cli/keygen.test.ts","packages/core/test/markers/keygen.test.ts"],"inputs":["tests/cli/keygen.test.ts","packages/core/test/markers/keygen.test.ts"]}},"requirements":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1}]},"approval_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"none"},"approval_resolution_required_at_run_start":false,"required_evidence":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1,"status":"missing"}],"evidence_summary":{"readiness":"missing","active_evidence_ids":[],"basis":"no_active_evidence"},"freshness_summary":{"state":"unknown","basis":"missing_evidence"},"known_gaps":[{"code":"evidence_missing","message":"Required evidence is missing; live performance is still required.","severity":"warning"}],"selection_reasons":["Critical value use case.","Golden journey coverage.","Rare usage frequency."],"selection_reason_codes":["value_critical","journey_golden","frequency_rare"],"score_components":{"changed":0,"value":400,"journey":50,"frequency":10}},{"plan_item_id":"item.signing.tier.prove_never_signs_what_it_cannot_recompute","presentation_format":"reviewing","delivery_kind":"evidence_review","scenario_scope":"explicit","use_case_id":"signing.tier.prove_never_signs_what_it_cannot_recompute","use_case_title":"prove mints a signed proof only from a verification result it can re-derive","scenario_ids":["signing.tier.prove_never_signs_what_it_cannot_recompute.golden_signs_bound_passing_rows","signing.tier.prove_never_signs_what_it_cannot_recompute.bad_no_matching_result","signing.tier.prove_never_signs_what_it_cannot_recompute.bad_blocked_result","signing.tier.prove_never_signs_what_it_cannot_recompute.bad_hashes_no_longer_match","signing.tier.prove_never_signs_what_it_cannot_recompute.bad_unsafe_seam_without_the_env_var","signing.tier.prove_never_signs_what_it_cannot_recompute.bad_tampered_authority","signing.tier.prove_never_signs_what_it_cannot_recompute.edge_already_fresh_is_skipped","signing.tier.prove_never_signs_what_it_cannot_recompute.edge_authority_is_verbatim"],"use_case_content_hash":"sha256:3e9dae7e55e398e4560004c23a7d8d260eaa4c32d43e538d92c2651cb25c92b4","estimated_seconds":180,"estimate_source":"default_profile","setup_steps":[],"resolved_steps":["Run prove over a results file covering several bound rows.","Read which rows were signed and in what order.","Target a row that has no matching result in the results file.","Read the exit code and which proofs were still appended.","Supply a blocked result for a bound row.","Read whether a proof is minted.","Change the code after the result was written, then run prove.","Read what happens.","Run prove with --unsafe-assume-verification-result and no UCM_ALLOW_UNSAFE_VERIFICATION.","Read the result, then repeat with the variable set.","Alter the embedded authority block after signing.","Verify the event.","Run prove twice over the same results without --refresh, then once with it.","Compare what is minted each time.","Supply an explicit authority record and mint a proof.","Read the embedded block and re-validate freshness."],"expected_observations":["Every bound passing row is signed, in sorted order, and UNBOUND rows are skipped.","A signed proof embeds the SAME verification_context_hash the result carries.","A targeted row with no matching result fails with a nonzero exit, while passing rows are still appended.","A blocked result mints no proof and fails, because blocked is not passed.","Prove recomputes the hashes and refuses a result whose hashes do not match the current code.","A signature can never outlive the state it was taken over.","The unsafe seam is rejected without the environment variable, minting no proof and exiting nonzero.","It is honoured only when the variable is explicitly set, so the dangerous path cannot be taken by accident.","Tampering with the embedded authority breaks the signature.","An already-FRESH row is skipped unless --refresh is given.","A supplied authority is embedded verbatim and the signed event still verifies.","A freshly-proved event carries a schema-valid authority block, and provenance does not affect freshness.","Every bound passing row is signed, and its proof embeds the same verification context hash the result carried.","A result whose hashes no longer match the current code is refused, so a signature cannot outlive the state it was taken over.","The unsafe assume-verification seam is rejected unless its environment variable is explicitly set.","Tampering with an embedded authority block breaks the signature."],"teardown_steps":[],"required_permissions":[],"safety_cons