e repository.","Run scan with --repo pointed at the nested workspace directory itself.","Read whether its own markers are collected.","Copy a marked source file into a build output directory and into a worktree copy of the repo.","Scan from the parent root and read whether a duplicate binding slug is reported."],"expected_observations":["A directory carrying its own use-cases.yml or use-cases.yaml is not walked by the parent's scan.","The parent scan no longer emits UNREGISTERED_BINDING or ROW_NOT_FOUND for markers that belong to a nested workspace.","A nested workspace can never fail the parent's integrity gate.","The rule keys on the workspace config file, so a newly added nested workspace needs no hardcoded skip entry.","The check applies to child directories only; the product root's own config still scans the whole repository.","A nested workspace's own scan --repo <dir> is unaffected, because its config sits at its product root rather than below it.","A marker copied into a build directory or a repo copy is not scanned, so a copy never collides with the original.","No DUPLICATE_BINDING_SLUG is raised for a file the build produced.","A nested workspace's own `scan --repo <dir>` is unaffected, because its config sits at its product root rather than below it."],"teardown_steps":[],"required_permissions":[],"safety_constraints":[],"verification_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"requirements","verifiers":{"script":{"kind":"script","evidence_kind":"test_result","command":["pnpm","-s","vitest","run","tests/blackbox/lifecycle-signals.test.ts","-t","lifecycle.signals.nested_workspace_is_not_scanned"],"inputs":["tests/blackbox/lifecycle-signals.test.ts"]}},"requirements":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1}]},"approval_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"none"},"approval_resolution_required_at_run_start":false,"required_evidence":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1,"status":"missing"}],"evidence_su