se_id":"skills.assets.demo_gates","use_case_title":"Live showcase demos are gated on explicit user answers","scenario_ids":["skills.assets.demo_gates.golden_gates","skills.assets.demo_gates.bad_question_before_its_card","skills.assets.demo_gates.bad_reject_is_recorded_verbatim","skills.assets.demo_gates.edge_run_it_again_and_talking_record_nothing"],"use_case_content_hash":"sha256:33224322fa06be7750aad79be6df7befc9fcc7eb286201919d1966e23909f3f8","estimated_seconds":180,"estimate_source":"default_profile","setup_steps":[],"resolved_steps":["Send the item's demo card inline (Steps / Expect) as its own message and end the turn, then ask the readiness question in the next turn.","Perform exactly the card's steps with the chosen driver and presentation format.","Reprint the card with Actual filled, then ask approve / reject / run it again in that order.","Attempt to ask the readiness question in the same turn as the card.","Read what the skill requires instead.","Answer reject at the acceptance question, with notes.","Read what is recorded.","Answer run it again, then answer talking about it.","Read what each records."],"expected_observations":["No live run starts before an explicit ready answer.","An approve answer is recorded as the user's acceptance with their notes verbatim; the signed sign-off tier stays a separate opt-in path.","No question is ever asked before its card has been delivered as its own completed message.","A reject answer records the user's notes verbatim, rather than being softened or summarised.","Run it again re-performs and re-asks without recording; talking about it records nothing.","No live run starts before an explicit ready answer, and no question is ever asked before its card has been delivered as its own completed message.","A reject answer records the user's notes verbatim; run it again re-performs and re-asks without recording; talking about it records nothing."],"teardown_steps":[],"required_permissions":[],"safety_constraints":[],"verif