ange a relevant input, then resume.","Read which verdicts are marked stale.","Change source, matrix or plan inputs under a paused run.","Resume and read the previous verdicts.","Resume across a revision change, then rerun one stale verdict and carry another forward.","Read the status of each."],"expected_observations":["Affected verdicts are marked stale until they are re-performed.","Old verdicts do not silently remain current after relevant changes.","A stale verdict stays stale until it is either rerun or explicitly carried forward."],"teardown_steps":[],"required_permissions":[],"safety_constraints":[],"verification_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"requirements","requirements":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1}]},"approval_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"none"},"approval_resolution_required_at_run_start":false,"required_evidence":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1,"status":"missing"}],"evidence_summary":{"readiness":"missing","active_evidence_ids":[],"basis":"no_active_evidence"},"freshness_summary":{"state":"unknown","basis":"missing_evidence"},"known_gaps":[{"code":"evidence_missing","message":"Required evidence is missing; live performance is still required.","severity":"warning"}],"selection_reasons":["Core value use case.","Edge journey coverage.","Occasional usage frequency."],"selection_reason_codes":["value_core","journey_edge","frequency_occasional"],"score_components":{"changed":0,"value":300,"journey":45,"frequency":20}},{"plan_item_id":"item.evidence.ledger.crash_durable_ledger_writes","presentation_format":"reviewing","delivery_kind":"evidence_review","scenario_scope":"explicit","use_case_id":"evidence.ledger.crash_durable_ledger_writes","use_case_title":"Crash-durable ledger writes","scenario_ids":["evidence.ledger.crash_durable_ledger_writes.golden_atomic_append","evidence.ledger.crash_durable_ledger_writes.bad_non_degradable_fsync_failure_propagates","evidence.ledger.crash_durable_ledger_writes.bad_best_effort_code_outside_the_temp_root","evidence.ledger.crash_durable_ledger_writes.edge_unsupported_temp_fsync_degrades"],"use_case_content_hash":"sha256:c3e5c10f78c361e5427bac709c2f22625a97afdf81372cf45ef6fc23ecc7afb3","estimated_seconds":180,"estimate_source":"default_profile","setup_steps":[],"resolved_steps":["Append an event so it is staged and flushed before the live ledger is replaced.","Read the ledger and check for partial lines.","Make the temp-file fsync fail in a way that is not a known unsupported case.","Append an event and read what happens.","Raise a normally best-effort error code from a path outside the temp root.","Append an event and read what happens.","Append on a filesystem that cannot fsync a temp file.","Read whether the write succeeded."],"expected_observations":["Each event is a whole line, never a partial one.","An interrupted append does not corrupt or truncate the existing ledger.","A non-degradable fsync failure still propagates, so corruption is never silent.","Degrading is a narrow allowance, not a blanket one.","A best-effort code raised outside the temp root still propagates, because the allowance is scoped to the staging file.","Durability degrades gracefully rather than throwing on unsupported temp-file sync."],"teardown_steps":[],"required_permissions":[],"safety_constraints":[],"verification_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"requirements","verifiers":{"script":{"kind":"script","evidence_kind":"test_result","command":["pnpm","-s","vitest","run","tests/use-cases/crash_durable_ledger_writes.test.ts"],"inputs":["tests/use-cases/crash_durable_ledger_writes.test.ts"]}},"requirements":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1}]},"approval_policy_snapshot":{"mode":"none"},"approval_resolution_required_at_run_start":false,"required_evidence":[{"evidence_kind":"test_result","required_verifiers":["script"],"minimum_count":1,"status":"missing"}],"evidence_summary":{"readin